The implicit flow obtains the access token out of band (typically in the browser). Pass the token to the authenticator:

```ruby
authenticator = {{moduleName}}::Auth::OAuth::OAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator.new('https://api.example.com', 'your-access-token')
client = {{moduleName}}::{{clientClassName}}.new(authenticator)
```

